("Is it okay to take something that isn't yours?","No. Ask first.","no|ask"),("Why should we share?","So everyone gets a turn and feels included.","turn|everyone|include"),
("What is a friend?","Someone who likes you and stays near.","like|near|stay"),("What does a good friend do?","Listens, shares and stays kind.","listen|share|kind"),
("What should you do if a friend is left out?","Invite them in. Make room.","invite|room|include"),("Is it nice to say mean things?","No. Kind words are better.","no|kind"),
("What is a hug for?","It says I care about you without words.","care|love"),("What is being brave?","Doing the right thing even when you're scared.","scared|right"),
